OL,3,GNEWSA'Everyone deserves to feel special
OL,4,Aon prom night'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity set up in memory of a
OL,7,F14-year-old girl who took her own life
OL,8,Fis offering help to families struggling
OL,9,Fwith the cost of school proms.
OL,11,FNext summer would have seen Sadie Reed
OL,12,Ffinish her last year at Maryport's
OL,13,FNetherhall School and attend her prom.
OL,15,FThe foundation bearing her name,
OL,16,Flaunched by her family to support west
OL,17,FCumbrian youngsters affected by mental
OL,18,Fhealth issues, has raised about #30,000
OL,19,Fover the last 18 months and now wants
OL,20,Fto provide support towards items such
OL,21,Fas dresses, suits, hair and make-up.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
